      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The borough evolved from Lenni Lenape land to Dutch, Swedish, English, and colonial control, with the Swedes building a mill in 1693.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
