      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yeadon%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The historic Palmer House stands as a landmark of Yeadon’s early residential architecture.",
